Provide both MP3 (broad compatibility) and OGG (smaller size for web). Phaser.js loads whichever the browser supports.

All music loops should be seamlessly loopable. Use Audacity or similar to trim loop points carefully.

atlas_player_ships.json + .png — All ship frames packed
atlas_enemies.json + .png — All enemy frames packed
atlas_bosses.json + .png — All boss frames (large atlas)
atlas_projectiles.json + .png
atlas_explosions.json + .png
atlas_powerups.json + .png
atlas_ui.json + .png — All UI elements packed
atlas_particles.json + .png
atlas_collectables.json + .png
animations.json — Phaser animation definitions (key, frames, frameRate, repeat)

levels.json — Level definitions: biome, wave count, enemy spawn tables, boss reference
enemies.json — Enemy stats: HP, speed, damage, score, drop table, sprite key
bosses.json — Boss stats, phase thresholds, attack patterns, loot
ships.json — Ship stats: speed, HP, fireRate, weapon, price, unlock condition
weapons.json — Weapon definitions: damage, speed, spread, cooldown, sprite key, sfx key
powerups.json — Powerup definitions: type, duration, value, sprite key, sfx key
waves.json — Wave spawn patterns: formation, timing, enemy type reference
biomes.json — Biome configs: background layers, ambient sfx, music key, enemy pool
collectables.json — Drop definitions: type, value, spawn weight
audio_manifest.json — All audio file paths and loop points for Phaser loader
asset_manifest.json — Complete asset preload list for Phaser preloader scene